# MVP Input Experience (SolenOS)

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-mvp-input-experience.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-mvp-input-experience.md)

## Feel

Handing over the care situation — not using software.

## Entry

**Snap · Scan · Upload · Share** = same pipeline. Not separate features.

Starting feel: *What is happening with the person you care for?*

## Auth

No signup/login/profile **before** first understanding.  
Anonymous care workspace OK. Auth when care memory is valuable enough to lose.

## Success

Caregiver understands better — not upload counts or account counts.

## Never

Onboarding homework · organize-before-upload · document summary as product · channel-specific product forks · example keyword templates

**Module:** `src/lib/mvp-input-experience` · **Verify:** `verify:mvp-input-experience`  
**Mechanics:** Input Entry Contract · First-time caregiver (B)
